What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/poc-version/<dev>/top/git_time
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	5.15
Contact:	Navid Jalali <navidcity@gmail.com>
Description:
		(RO) Commit time of the top-level design, from Top.GitTime,
		as an ISO 8601 time with a whole-hour time zone::

		  HH:MM:SS±hh\n

		Hours, minutes and seconds are zero-padded to at least two
		digits. The time zone is the signed offset from UTC in whole
		hours (a signed byte, -128 to +127): always a sign ("+" or
		"-", "+" for zero) followed by at least two digits.

		Present in Register layout 1.

		Examples::

		  23:59:59+01
		  14:03:09+00
		  14:03:09-05

What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/poc-version/<dev>/top/branch_name_tag
Date:		November 2026
