		Present in Register layout 1.

		Example::

		  main

What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/poc-version/<dev>/top/git_url
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	5.15
Contact:	Navid Jalali <navidcity@gmail.com>
Description:
		(RO) Git URL of the repository the top-level design was
		built from, from the 128-byte Top.GitURL block, as text::

		  <text>\n

		The text stops at the first null byte and never goes beyond
		the 128-byte block, so it is 0 to 128 bytes long. An empty
