		Present in Register layout 1.

		Example::

		  https://git.example.org/fpga/board.git

What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/poc-version/<dev>/uid/uid
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	5.15
Contact:	Navid Jalali <navidcity@gmail.com>
Description:
		(RO) UID, from the 16-byte UID.UID block, as a hex integer
		of exactly 32 lower-case hex digits without "0x", most
		significant word (highest offset) first::

		  <32 hex digits>\n

		This file always exists in Register layout 1. When the
		design does not provide a UID, the file reads all zeros.

		Examples::

		  000102030405060708090a0b0c0d0e0f
		  00000000000000000000000000000000

