		  00000000

What:		/sys/bus/platform/drivers/poc-version/<dev>/uid/user_id
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	5.15
Contact:	Navid Jalali <navidcity@gmail.com>
Description:
		(RO) User ID set at synthesis, from the 12-byte UID.User_ID
		block, as a hex integer of exactly 24 lower-case hex digits
		without "0x", most significant word (highest offset) first::

		  <24 hex digits>\n

		This file always exists in Register layout 1. When the
		design does not provide a User ID, the file reads all
		zeros.

		Examples::

		  00c0ffee0123456789abcdef
		  000000000000000000000000
